=2 Walkthrough
* To begin this quest in your log, you need the {k:Serpent Rumors} key item. It can be purchased from {n:Fennella} in {z:Port Windurst} (C-8) for 95,000 {p:Guild Points} with {p:Fishing} rank {p:Adept} or higher.
** You can still obtain the other items needed for this quest before initiating it.
* Turn in {i:Liks|Lik|5129} and {i:Gugrusaurus|Gugrusaurus|5127} to {n:Zaldon} to obtain {i:Opal Silk|Opal Silk|1826} and {i:Saber Shoot|Saber Shoot|1837}, respectively.
